# Build outputs never live in this repo — they go on /media/blankmcu/EmbeddedLinux
build*/
downloads/
sstate-cache/
poky/
meta-raspberrypi/
meta-rauc/
meta-rauc-community/
meta-lts-mixins/
*.img
*.wic
*.wic.bz2
*.raucb

# Private keys, ever, under any name. The RAUC signing keys live on the
# build disk (scripts/rauc-gen-keys.sh) and must never reach this public
# repo; this is the backstop in case one is ever copied here by mistake.
# The CA *certificate* is public and deliberately NOT ignored — it is the
# trust anchor baked into every image.
*.key.pem
*.key
private/

# Editor noise
*.swp
.vscode/

# --- Session 15: capstone credentials ---------------------------------------
# The Pi Zero W's WiFi PSK is provisioned onto the card by
# scripts/provision-card.sh, which reads it from ~/.rpi0-secrets/ — OUTSIDE
# this repository, and the script refuses to run if SECRETS_DIR points
# inside it. These patterns are the backstop for the obvious mistake:
# copying the real config next to the .example to edit it. The .example
# itself is tracked deliberately (it contains only a zeroed placeholder).
wpa_supplicant*.conf
!*wpa_supplicant*.conf.example
.rpi0-secrets/
